239
00:18:49.520 --> 00:18:51.500
Karmen, ma pean sinuga rääkima.

240
00:18:51.600 --> 00:18:54.019
Minge.

241
00:18:54.119 --> 00:18:56.400
Nii,

242
00:18:56.500 --> 00:18:59.019
