siis on eriti väga nagu väga pekkis.

314
00:26:21.890 --> 00:26:23.570
Räägib?

315
00:26:23.670 --> 00:26:25.895
Ma ei saa

316
00:26:27.980 --> 00:26:30.405
äkki see on nagu.

317
00:26:40.260 --> 00:26:42.980
Kas sul on vanemad kodus?
Mul ei olegi kodus.
